@startuml
title Local classroom system
actor Teacher
actor Student
component "Independent local student browsers (TypeScript)" as U
rectangle "Teacher computer" {
 component "Teacher UI (TypeScript)" as T
 component "Node.js HTTP + Socket.IO" as S
 component "Activity reducer + memory store" as M
 component "Google adapter + parser" as G
}
cloud "Google authorization + Sheets" as C
Teacher --> T
Student --> U
T --> S : teacher session
U --> S : local URL + anonymous session
S --> M : ordered commands
S --> G : teacher operations
G --> C : HTTPS
note bottom of M
Single process, one active activity.
Restart discards all activity state.
Role-specific snapshots only.
Acceptance uses separate browsers on one computer.
Cross-device LAN acceptance is out of current scope.
end note
@enduml
